00:00:59.558 --> 00:01:00.543
You don't need no money.

00:01:00.543 --> 00:01:02.291
You don't need no stuff.

00:01:02.291 --> 00:01:04.120
The one thing you need to do

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:06.418
to go where you've never gone before,

00:01:06.418 --> 00:01:08.295
